:"java.example.151d9db9aaa0d71cf39c","lessonId":"java.lesson.151d9db9aaa0d71cf39c","status":"runnable-required","reason":"可用 Java Rust/WASM 执行并查看真实轨迹。","source":"import java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static int gap(int a, int b) {\n        if (a < b) {\n            return b - a;\n        }\n        return a - b;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner input = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int a = input.nextInt();\n        int b = input.nextInt();\n        System.out.println(gap(a, b));\n    }\n}","sourceSha256":"0be749e47a68486f804e5621afcf8f4ece2b3a7fdcb7d5548cec248398d8be5b","cases":[{"name":"输入 1","input":"3 8","stdout":"5\n"},{"name":"输入 2","input":"8 3","stdout":"5\n"},{"name":"输入 3","input":"-1000 1000","stdout":"2000\n"},{"name":"输入 4","input":"-2 -2","stdout":"0\n"}]},{"id":"java.example.9241ea94e146b0863be9","lessonId":"java.lesson.9241ea94e146b0863be9","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"static void announce() { System.out.println(\"到站\"); }，int n = announce(); 是否有效？","result":"无效。应使用独立的 announce(); 调用语句。"},{"id":"java.example.9afac961a22d3fd4a9e6","lessonId":"java.lesson.9afac961a22d3fd4a9e6","status":"runnable-required","reason":"可用 Java Rust/WASM 执行并查看真实轨迹。","source":"import java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static void replace(int[] copy, int value) {\n        copy[0] = value;\n        copy = new int[1];\n        copy[0] = 99;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner input = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int[] original = new int[1];\n        int value = input.nextInt();\n        replace(original, value);\n        System.out.println(original[0]);\n    }\n}","sourceSha256":"08c4eb8f9c28604b4c2adb296d8d191739ab5197af6c78e42aabf1318b924158","cases":[{"name":"输入 1","input":"0","stdout":"0\n"},{"name":"输入 2","input":"7","stdout":"7\n"},{"name":"输入 3","input":"-5","stdout":"-5\n"},{"name":"输入 4","input":"2147483647","stdout":"2147483647\n"}]},{"id":"java.example.fce75814faf2760fbc53","lessonId":"java.lesson.fce75814faf2760fbc53","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"static void clear(int n) { n=0; } 接收变量 count=5，返回后 count 变了吗？","result":"没有，仍是 5。被改成 0 的是方法参数的副本。"},{"id":"java.example.c426d54e35d7624b7b5e","lessonId":"java.lesson.c426d54e35d7624b7b5e","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"只有 int parse(String s) 和 long parse(String s) 的区别是返回类型，能否共存？","result":"不能。参数列表相同，调用无法仅凭名字和实参区分它们。"},{"id":"java.example.cd64baebf6be1e796f43","lessonId":"java.lesson.cd64baebf6be1e796f43","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"递归调用中两层各有参数 n，改写内层 n 会不会改外层？","result":"不会。每层帧持有独立参数绑定。"},{"id":"java.example.fbcd5fc3450ae6664a4e","lessonId":"java.lesson.fbcd5fc3450ae6664a4e","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"本机按该命令启动时，args[0] 内容是什么？","result":"通常为“北门 3”，外层引号用于 shell 分组。若没有参数，应避免直接访问下标 0。"},{"id":"java.example.14bab42c3e33cfe7e103","lessonId":"java.lesson.14bab42c3e33cfe7e103","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"class Tag { int code; Tag(int code) { this.code=code; } }，new Tag(8) 的字段是多少？","result":"字段为 8。右侧是参数，左侧是新实例的字段。"},{"id":"java.example.47f70d449790f1d2e0fe","lessonId":"java.lesson.47f70d449790f1d2e0fe","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"static int count(int... xs) { return xs.length; } 中 count() 返回什么？","result":"返回 0。输入数组为空，方法仍可正常读取 length。"},{"id":"java.example.1082310ec72def413a2a","lessonId":"java.lesson.1082310ec72def413a2a","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"读取一个文件后要立即释放句柄，可以依赖对象变为不可达吗？","result":"不可以。使用明确的 close 或 try-with-resources，使退出作用域时释放句柄。"}],"activities":[{"id":"java.check.58b4ae94871dd70efdd1","lessonId":"java.lesson.58b4ae94871dd70efdd1","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.58b4ae94871dd70efdd1","prompt":"int doubled(int n) { return n+n; } 的输入和返回分别是什么？","reveal":"输入是一个 int，返回其两倍的 int 值；这段方法本身没有输出动作。"},{"id":"java.check.b8bbfc49a2d9ce553061","lessonId":"java.lesson.b8bbfc49a2d9ce553061","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.b8bbfc49a2d9ce553061","prompt":"五个入口都要检查同一优惠阈值，应把条件复制五遍吗？","reveal":"可抽成共享方法，让阈值改变时集中更新并单独验证。"},{"id":"java.check.e2bdc9318c5d7852a3fe","lessonId":"java.lesson.e2bdc9318c5d7852a3fe","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.e2bdc9318c5d7852a3fe","prompt":"判断票是否过期，用 isExpired 还是 processTicket 更准确？","reveal":"isExpired 直接表明得到一个真假结果，processTicket 无法说明行为。"},{"id":"java.check.1a53be4b4a409abfab35","lessonId":"java.lesson.1a53be4b4a409abfab35","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.1a53be4b4a409abfab35","prompt":"static int gap(int high, int low) { return high-low; } 中 gap(9,4) 的结果是多少？","reveal":"为 5。第一个参数 high 绑定 9，第二个 low 绑定 4。"},{"id":"java.practice.method-gap","lessonId":"java.lesson.151d9db9aaa0d71cf39c","kind":"rust-judge","profileRef":{"id":"java.practice.method-gap","version":"1.0.0"},"title":"实例","task":"读两个 -1000 到 1000 的 int。调用自行定义的 static int 方法求两数的非负差，并打印返回值。","observation":"输出来自有实际参数绑定与返回的用户静态调用，返回值的数值或控制贡献覆盖两个输入。","hints":["把计算移到 static int gap 中，主方法负责读取和输出。","试同一对数的两种顺序，检查返回值不变且分支轨迹不同。"],"caseCount":4},{"id":"java.check.9241ea94e146b0863be9","lessonId":"java.lesson.9241ea94e146b0863be9","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.9241ea94e146b0863be9","prompt":"static void announce() { System.out.println(\"到站\"); }，int n = announce(); 是否有效？","reveal":"无效。应使用独立的 announce(); 调用语句。"},{"id":"java.practice.reference-parameter","lessonId":"java.lesson.9afac961a22d3fd4a9e6","kind":"rust-judge","profileRef":{"id":"java.practice.reference-parameter","version":"1.0.0"},"title":"通过值传递参数","task":"在主方法创建长度为 1 的 int[]。读一个 int，经静态辅助方法写入元素；在辅助方法内把参数重新绑定为新数组并写入 99。回主方法打印原数组的首项。","observation":"辅助帧经参数写入原数组，再改绑到另一对象。输出由调用后对原数组的实际读取产生。","hints":["第一次写入发生在 new 之前，第二次发生在 new 之后。","回放两次写入并核对对象 ID。主方法读取的应是第一次写入的那个对象。"],"caseCount":4},{"id":"java.check.fce75814faf2760fbc53","lessonId":"java.lesson.fce75814faf2760fbc53","kind":"op